(4637818, 668988, 70177, '<td valign="top">well, although this is a challenge for water, i had to stick this photo in photoshop and play with the levels myself, after playing with it, i realized, it is a nice looking sunset, but if you boost the contrast +16 and drop the brightness 18, somewhere in there, the image turns into a audio spectrum that you would use to edit a sound in a remaster program.</td>', 'well, although this is a challenge for water, i had to stick this photo in photoshop and play with the levels myself, after playing with it, i realized, it is a nice looking sunset, but if you boost the contrast +16 and drop the brightness 18, somewhere in there, the image turns into a audio spectrum that you would use to edit a sound in a remaster program.', '2008-04-14 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
