(4638014, 667660, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Some comments...<br/>1. Is the horizon level?  It doesn''t quite feel it<br/>2. Maybe a saturation boost on the reds would help bring the reflections out a bit more<br/>3. Overall the shot feels cramped in the frame, we need some empty space above and below if possible<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Nice shot.  Some comments...1. Is the horizon level?  It doesn''t quite feel it2. Maybe a saturation boost on the reds would help bring the reflections out a bit more3. Overall the shot feels cramped in the frame, we need some empty space above and below if possible Good luck with the challenge!', '2008-04-14 03:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4638066, 667150, 68035, '<td valign="top">Thank you thank you thank you for displaying the raw power of water rather than going with the long exposure soft water effect.  Great sharpness and a spectacular array or greens and aqua''s</td>', 'Thank you thank you thank you for displaying the raw power of water rather than going with the long exposure soft water effect.  Great sharpness and a spectacular array or greens and aqua''s', '2008-04-14 04:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
