(4638973, 666678, 7786, '<td valign="top">Both the concept and composition are good. The processing needs to improve. The object in the water is over sharpened as there are halos where bright and dark parts meet. I use USM @ radius=0.3 strenght=150-200 to sharpen my images after resize.</td>', 'Both the concept and composition are good. The processing needs to improve. The object in the water is over sharpened as there are halos where bright and dark parts meet. I use USM @ radius=0.3 strenght=150-200 to sharpen my images after resize.', '2008-04-14 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
