(4639504, 669101, 90495, '<td valign="top">I''m most probably not the first to say this. It''s lacking in contrast a bit. I know you''ll most likely lose detail in the left side tree line  by adding contrast but that won''t matter. The overall gain in blacks and whites will make this an even better looking image.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful landscape that captures the challenge well with the water encompassing the foreground leading us to the horizon and the mountains. Lovely composition.</td>', 'I''m most probably not the first to say this. It''s lacking in contrast a bit. I know you''ll most likely lose detail in the left side tree line  by adding contrast but that won''t matter. The overall gain in blacks and whites will make this an even better looking image. It''s a beautiful landscape that captures the challenge well with the water encompassing the foreground leading us to the horizon and the mountains. Lovely composition.', '2008-04-14 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
