(4641604, 668770, 82985, '<td valign="top">wonder how much flak you will get for the oof gull?  Well, from me, you get an 8 because I think the oof gull MAKES this image work even better.</td>', 'wonder how much flak you will get for the oof gull?  Well, from me, you get an 8 because I think the oof gull MAKES this image work even better.', '2008-04-15 21:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641606, 667861, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is just a wonderful luminous abstract  8</td>', 'This is just a wonderful luminous abstract  8', '2008-04-15 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641608, 668643, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love this.  You might consider cloning out the lower left corner element as it might help the overall composition (and might not--worth a look though). I like the title, and it keeps me puzzled: is this liquid water frozen by the camera, or frozen water captured by the camera.  If liquid, how did you achieve this shape?  Thanks for sharing this image with us.  8</td>', 'I love this.  You might consider cloning out the lower left corner element as it might help the overall composition (and might not--worth a look though). I like the title, and it keeps me puzzled: is this liquid water frozen by the camera, or frozen water captured by the camera.  If liquid, how did you achieve this shape?  Thanks for sharing this image with us.  8', '2008-04-15 21:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641609, 669096, 92245, '<td valign="top">full of personality<br/>makes me smile</td>', 'full of personalitymakes me smile', '2008-04-15 21:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641615, 668626, 82985, '<td valign="top">this is great!  I find myself wondering if this was cropped in from the left, down from the top, and if it might be even better if the neck was not out of frame.  Or, cropping a bit more to lose the blue bit in the upper left.  Gosh, it must be annoying to read a stream of consciousness comment like this.  Don''t mind me, Well Done! 7</td>', 'this is great!  I find myself wondering if this was cropped in from the left, down from the top, and if it might be even better if the neck was not out of frame.  Or, cropping a bit more to lose the blue bit in the upper left.  Gosh, it must be annoying to read a stream of consciousness comment like this.  Don''t mind me, Well Done! 7', '2008-04-15 21:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641617, 668901, 82985, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and concept--well seen.  I wonder if some pp on the levels and a touch of saturation would make this image richer and deeper?  7</td>', 'I really like this image and concept--well seen.  I wonder if some pp on the levels and a touch of saturation would make this image richer and deeper?  7', '2008-04-15 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641619, 667218, 82985, '<td valign="top">Just wonderfully seen and done.  possibly a crop up from the bottom of about 5% to remove some of the grassy foreground might be good, but it might stink on ice, too.  7</td>', 'Just wonderfully seen and done.  possibly a crop up from the bottom of about 5% to remove some of the grassy foreground might be good, but it might stink on ice, too.  7', '2008-04-15 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641620, 668925, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun abstraction! 7</td>', 'This is a really fun abstraction! 7', '2008-04-15 21:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641621, 669122, 82985, '<td valign="top">This image is so full of motion, so dynamic, even though it was probably a fairly static scene.  very nice indeed. 7</td>', 'This image is so full of motion, so dynamic, even though it was probably a fairly static scene.  very nice indeed. 7', '2008-04-15 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641624, 668340, 82985, '<td valign="top">graceful, peaceful image.  the front edge of the leave is nicely focused, and nice bokeh on the far edge.  perhaps if the water drop were also tack sharp, it would look even better than it already does. 6</td>', 'graceful, peaceful image.  the front edge of the leave is nicely focused, and nice bokeh on the far edge.  perhaps if the water drop were also tack sharp, it would look even better than it already does. 6', '2008-04-15 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
