(4644406, 669188, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/5 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:7/7 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total:6.2 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: While the symmetry is quite successful here, without any asymmetrical ordering by weight (progression from dark to light, bottom to top), this quiet shot would, IMO, hardly rouse an interest. The resulting overall balance and the tension between the two diverging measures, however, make a compelling case for exploring the whole image, despite its singular, centred focal point. The quality of detail in the reflection, especially in the distorted parts, is a lovely asset.<br/> <br/>The title, although unspectacular, labels the photo aptly.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/5 Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/6 Aesthetics/Technical:7/7 Presentation: 6 Total:6.2 Vote: 6  Remarks: While the symmetry is quite successful here, without any asymmetrical ordering by weight (progression from dark to light, bottom to top), this quiet shot would, IMO, hardly rouse an interest. The resulting overall balance and the tension between the two diverging measures, however, make a compelling case for exploring the whole image, despite its singular, centred focal point. The quality of detail in the reflection, especially in the distorted parts, is a lovely asset. The title, although unspectacular, labels the photo aptly.', '2008-04-16 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
