(4644963, 669185, 39184, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I like the concept here but it''s compromised by the title which contradicts what is presented in the image.  I like how you were able to use a narrow dof to blur the background while capturing the details of the background in the water drop.</td>', 'Oooh, I like the concept here but it''s compromised by the title which contradicts what is presented in the image.  I like how you were able to use a narrow dof to blur the background while capturing the details of the background in the water drop.', '2008-04-16 23:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644964, 667660, 39184, '<td valign="top">Great reflection on the water.  I would have instinctively gone with a longer shutter speed but that would have blurred the reflection instead of capturing it the way you did.</td>', 'Great reflection on the water.  I would have instinctively gone with a longer shutter speed but that would have blurred the reflection instead of capturing it the way you did.', '2008-04-16 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644967, 667150, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, especially considering the harsh overhead light.  I''d like to see this shot much earlier or later in the day.  I look forward to the end of the challenge to see where this was taken.</td>', 'Nice capture, especially considering the harsh overhead light.  I''d like to see this shot much earlier or later in the day.  I look forward to the end of the challenge to see where this was taken.', '2008-04-16 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644970, 669126, 39184, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Is this yours <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=23394" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skip</a>?  If not, then consider the mistake a compliment as this shot definitely rivals similiar shots of his...and his are good. 10</td>', 'Awesome!  Is this yours  skip?  If not, then consider the mistake a compliment as this shot definitely rivals similiar shots of his...and his are good. 10', '2008-04-16 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644974, 669099, 39184, '<td valign="top">Looking at this picture, I keep wanting to turn the camera to the right a little.  I think I''d like to have seen this composed so that the end of the shore/rocks on the right were within the frame.</td>', 'Looking at this picture, I keep wanting to turn the camera to the right a little.  I think I''d like to have seen this composed so that the end of the shore/rocks on the right were within the frame.', '2008-04-17 00:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644983, 669134, 39184, '<td valign="top">The water seems unnaturally dark here.  I can''t help but wonder if this is how it looked in person or if this is a result of post processing.  Since you have a definite and clean seperation between the rocks and the water, it would be easy to expose the two areas seperately and combine them here in advanced editing.</td>', 'The water seems unnaturally dark here.  I can''t help but wonder if this is how it looked in person or if this is a result of post processing.  Since you have a definite and clean seperation between the rocks and the water, it would be easy to expose the two areas seperately and combine them here in advanced editing.', '2008-04-17 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644988, 669090, 39184, '<td valign="top">Something seems off here in regards to the color, maybe it''s the white balance.  Try composing this next time so that the straw doesn''t terminate or cross the branches in the background.  I like the concept and the out of the box thinking with the straw in the catcus.</td>', 'Something seems off here in regards to the color, maybe it''s the white balance.  Try composing this next time so that the straw doesn''t terminate or cross the branches in the background.  I like the concept and the out of the box thinking with the straw in the catcus.', '2008-04-17 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644995, 669072, 39184, '<td valign="top">Thicker <u>than</u>...This really stands out for me, especially in the title.  I like the contrast between the clear water in the glass and the very interesting shape of the colored drop descending.  The off centered composition works well here.</td>', 'Thicker than...This really stands out for me, especially in the title.  I like the contrast between the clear water in the glass and the very interesting shape of the colored drop descending.  The off centered composition works well here.', '2008-04-17 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645001, 668403, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean look to this shot.  I like the contrast between the crisp focus on the buildings and the blur of the reflection.  It does, however, seem like a bit more color on the water than what I see in the background.  That won''t lower my score though because I can''t be sure that it''s not simply a product of the long exposure. 8</td>', 'Nice and clean look to this shot.  I like the contrast between the crisp focus on the buildings and the blur of the reflection.  It does, however, seem like a bit more color on the water than what I see in the background.  That won''t lower my score though because I can''t be sure that it''s not simply a product of the long exposure. 8', '2008-04-17 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645006, 668971, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice job here.  I have a difficult time gettin shots like this done right.</td>', 'Nice job here.  I have a difficult time gettin shots like this done right.', '2008-04-17 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645011, 668668, 39184, '<td valign="top">Harsh overhead light hurts this shot because of the blown out reflections on the leaves.  The long exposure, however, makes the water come out nice and silky.</td>', 'Harsh overhead light hurts this shot because of the blown out reflections on the leaves.  The long exposure, however, makes the water come out nice and silky.', '2008-04-17 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645013, 669168, 39184, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I wonder how many times you had to refreeze and retake the shot.</td>', 'Very creative.  I wonder how many times you had to refreeze and retake the shot.', '2008-04-17 00:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645015, 668901, 39184, '<td valign="top">One of the most unique approaches to this challenge.</td>', 'One of the most unique approaches to this challenge.', '2008-04-17 00:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645018, 669149, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure.  Good job controlling the blown highlights.</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure.  Good job controlling the blown highlights.', '2008-04-17 00:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645020, 668686, 39184, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective.  Looks like a little bit of haloing around the shoulders and head from darkening the sky.</td>', 'Cool perspective.  Looks like a little bit of haloing around the shoulders and head from darkening the sky.', '2008-04-17 00:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645022, 668786, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean and simple.  Simple looking, that is with the uncomplicated background.  Freezing these waterdrops like this was probably far from simple.</td>', 'Nice, clean and simple.  Simple looking, that is with the uncomplicated background.  Freezing these waterdrops like this was probably far from simple.', '2008-04-17 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645027, 667770, 39184, '<td valign="top">This is a difficult shot to get.  I know because I just returned from a four day trip that included canoe on two rivers with cypress trees.  The bright reflections take distract from this.  I found that thick cloud cover and finding a group of trees with thick dense foilage in the background helps to avoid the bright reglections.  The shot also needs to be rotated clockwise about 5 degrees also.</td>', 'This is a difficult shot to get.  I know because I just returned from a four day trip that included canoe on two rivers with cypress trees.  The bright reflections take distract from this.  I found that thick cloud cover and finding a group of trees with thick dense foilage in the background helps to avoid the bright reglections.  The shot also needs to be rotated clockwise about 5 degrees also.', '2008-04-17 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645028, 668709, 39184, '<td valign="top">The processing on this image is a good balance between exposing detail in the rocks and not blowing out <u>too</u> much of the breakers.</td>', 'The processing on this image is a good balance between exposing detail in the rocks and not blowing out too much of the breakers.', '2008-04-17 00:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645032, 669165, 39184, '<td valign="top">I think the duck took a break.</td>', 'I think the duck took a break.', '2008-04-17 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645033, 668667, 63503, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?!! (8)</td>', 'How did you do this?!! (8)', '2008-04-17 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645034, 668197, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape</td>', 'Beautiful landscape', '2008-04-17 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645036, 668232, 90495, '<td valign="top">Cool, after I realized what I was looking at. Thought it was a dandelion in late bloom.</td>', 'Cool, after I realized what I was looking at. Thought it was a dandelion in late bloom.', '2008-04-17 00:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645039, 669165, 63503, '<td valign="top">Where is the duck?</td>', 'Where is the duck?', '2008-04-17 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645041, 668786, 63503, '<td valign="top">I am perplexed by this image, how did you get the coulmn of dropping drops to be NOT perpendicular to the surface? Nice picture though (8)</td>', 'I am perplexed by this image, how did you get the coulmn of dropping drops to be NOT perpendicular to the surface? Nice picture though (8)', '2008-04-17 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645043, 669087, 63503, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but it appears to be a bit oversaturated</td>', 'I like this image, but it appears to be a bit oversaturated', '2008-04-17 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
