(4645132, 668232, 38930, '<td valign="top">WHOAH!!!</td>', 'WHOAH!!!', '2008-04-17 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645134, 669170, 77724, '<td valign="top">this is crazy... in a good way; made me smile.</td>', 'this is crazy... in a good way; made me smile.', '2008-04-17 01:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645139, 669188, 77724, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2008-04-17 01:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645335, 669174, 73942, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great leading lines, reflection, colors.  This picture has it all.  The title truly descibes the feeling this photo conveys.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great leading lines, reflection, colors.  This picture has it all.  The title truly descibes the feeling this photo conveys.', '2008-04-17 07:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645337, 669113, 73942, '<td valign="top">This may be a water challenge, but your sky is awesome.  I love how it lights up the water.  Beautiful!</td>', 'This may be a water challenge, but your sky is awesome.  I love how it lights up the water.  Beautiful!', '2008-04-17 07:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645413, 668629, 49109, '<td valign="top">reminds me of tales like "Lord of the rings"  - which I don''t like, but the shot and the processing is great. exceptional, how the foreground and background are isolated by color.</td>', 'reminds me of tales like "Lord of the rings"  - which I don''t like, but the shot and the processing is great. exceptional, how the foreground and background are isolated by color.', '2008-04-17 08:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645416, 667592, 49109, '<td valign="top">good focus and composition. had prefered if she hadn''t breathed out in the moment of shooting</td>', 'good focus and composition. had prefered if she hadn''t breathed out in the moment of shooting', '2008-04-17 08:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645417, 668667, 49109, '<td valign="top">poor fishy, how many times did you take him out of the water just to throw him back in again?<br/>good attempt, not enough light on the fish and the background, too many refractions in the water, crop at top is a little close</td>', 'poor fishy, how many times did you take him out of the water just to throw him back in again?good attempt, not enough light on the fish and the background, too many refractions in the water, crop at top is a little close', '2008-04-17 08:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645426, 667795, 49109, '<td valign="top">good advertising shot, really looks kinda refreshing. <br/>I''d change some things, though:<br/>it seems she is looking at the glass rather than at the camera; eye contact had made this even more convincing.<br/>lighting is too frontal, a second light source or reflector from the right had helped much.<br/>i like the use of wide angle here, but a slightly lower POV (below her eye level) had created more impact and excluded her leg from the composition.<br/> cream topping would have been her hair and swimsuit being wet.</td>', 'good advertising shot, really looks kinda refreshing. I''d change some things, though:it seems she is looking at the glass rather than at the camera; eye contact had made this even more convincing.lighting is too frontal, a second light source or reflector from the right had helped much.i like the use of wide angle here, but a slightly lower POV (below her eye level) had created more impact and excluded her leg from the composition. cream topping would have been her hair and swimsuit being wet.', '2008-04-17 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645434, 668954, 49109, '<td valign="top">the magic of glycerine :)</td>', 'the magic of glycerine :)', '2008-04-17 09:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645437, 669165, 46885, '<td valign="top">Invisible duck, right?</td>', 'Invisible duck, right?', '2008-04-17 09:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645442, 669165, 49109, '<td valign="top">mysterious. somehow intriguing. good b/w tones. can''t find the duck, though, did you crop it off?</td>', 'mysterious. somehow intriguing. good b/w tones. can''t find the duck, though, did you crop it off?', '2008-04-17 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645818, 668641, 92320, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like the variation of the color in the ropes.</td>', 'Great shot, I like the variation of the color in the ropes.', '2008-04-17 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645823, 668725, 92320, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.</td>', 'Good action shot.', '2008-04-17 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645832, 668801, 58457, '<td valign="top">Duck photos usually don''t tend to thrill me, but this is a really nice capture.  It has a few things going for it... good light, great sharpness, a cool shape created between the bill and the water with the reflection and the nice circular ripples created from the bill.</td>', 'Duck photos usually don''t tend to thrill me, but this is a really nice capture.  It has a few things going for it... good light, great sharpness, a cool shape created between the bill and the water with the reflection and the nice circular ripples created from the bill.', '2008-04-17 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645833, 668629, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think putting your little elf/hobbit character in the photo was wise, as some of the other subjectless waterfall photos in this challenge come off a bit boring.  Your character adds interest and intrigue to your photo.  I also like the mood that the vignetting adds to the scene.</td>', 'I think putting your little elf/hobbit character in the photo was wise, as some of the other subjectless waterfall photos in this challenge come off a bit boring.  Your character adds interest and intrigue to your photo.  I also like the mood that the vignetting adds to the scene.', '2008-04-17 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645834, 669016, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a really crisp and nice photo.  A great exposure on a white animal--i can still see the lines of feathers in the whitest part.  the drip and bill are nice.  my only thought for improvement would be to crop off most of the left side--i feel like the shot might have more impact that way.</td>', 'This is a really crisp and nice photo.  A great exposure on a white animal--i can still see the lines of feathers in the whitest part.  the drip and bill are nice.  my only thought for improvement would be to crop off most of the left side--i feel like the shot might have more impact that way.', '2008-04-17 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645835, 667506, 58457, '<td valign="top">very sci fi feel here, I think its the blueness that does it.  Spooky and haunting, yet very nice, this one is right up there with the best in the challenge for me.</td>', 'very sci fi feel here, I think its the blueness that does it.  Spooky and haunting, yet very nice, this one is right up there with the best in the challenge for me.', '2008-04-17 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645836, 668954, 58457, '<td valign="top">This photograph is insane!  I can feel the softness of it oozing from my computer screen.  I think you''ll score high in this challenge.</td>', 'This photograph is insane!  I can feel the softness of it oozing from my computer screen.  I think you''ll score high in this challenge.', '2008-04-17 13:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645837, 668777, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the colors that show up in the drips... that is pretty cool.</td>', 'I like the colors that show up in the drips... that is pretty cool.', '2008-04-17 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645842, 668698, 73235, '<td valign="top">creative DOF, good focus on the drop</td>', 'creative DOF, good focus on the drop', '2008-04-17 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645846, 667629, 73235, '<td valign="top">very strong good colors.</td>', 'very strong good colors.', '2008-04-17 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645851, 668946, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the strong reflections in the water. well executed noght shot</td>', 'I like the strong reflections in the water. well executed noght shot', '2008-04-17 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645854, 667218, 73235, '<td valign="top">very nice symmetry</td>', 'very nice symmetry', '2008-04-17 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645860, 668598, 73235, '<td valign="top">that bright little stream leads beutifully into your picture. well done</td>', 'that bright little stream leads beutifully into your picture. well done', '2008-04-17 13:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645862, 668527, 73235, '<td valign="top">good imagination.</td>', 'good imagination.', '2008-04-17 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645864, 668669, 73235, '<td valign="top">great contrast between the dark blue water and the bright blue sky. good PP on the clouds.</td>', 'great contrast between the dark blue water and the bright blue sky. good PP on the clouds.', '2008-04-17 13:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645867, 668800, 73235, '<td valign="top">great macro. One of my favs in the challenge.</td>', 'great macro. One of my favs in the challenge.', '2008-04-17 13:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645872, 669160, 73235, '<td valign="top">looks very dramatic</td>', 'looks very dramatic', '2008-04-17 13:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645873, 668649, 73235, '<td valign="top">appears to be very flat.</td>', 'appears to be very flat.', '2008-04-17 13:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645874, 668626, 73235, '<td valign="top">good details and colors</td>', 'good details and colors', '2008-04-17 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645878, 669126, 73235, '<td valign="top">just enough frozen to show details, just enough blurred to show the dynamics.</td>', 'just enough frozen to show details, just enough blurred to show the dynamics.', '2008-04-17 13:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645880, 669113, 73235, '<td valign="top">love the drama. 10</td>', 'love the drama. 10', '2008-04-17 13:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645881, 668988, 73235, '<td valign="top">great symmetry. strong colors, 10</td>', 'great symmetry. strong colors, 10', '2008-04-17 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645901, 668786, 73235, '<td valign="top">very clean and clear. 10</td>', 'very clean and clear. 10', '2008-04-17 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645991, 667629, 46885, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, although two parts of the image somehow clash.</td>', 'Very interesting, although two parts of the image somehow clash.', '2008-04-17 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645997, 668667, 46885, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen gators jumping out of water that high, but what did you lure that goldfish with?</td>', 'I''ve seen gators jumping out of water that high, but what did you lure that goldfish with?', '2008-04-17 15:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646000, 668521, 46885, '<td valign="top">the simplest of the good pictures I''ve seen in this challenge. Increased DOF wouldn''t hurt.</td>', 'the simplest of the good pictures I''ve seen in this challenge. Increased DOF wouldn''t hurt.', '2008-04-17 15:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646003, 668941, 46885, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup, idea and light, I would just change the hose to something simpler - the elaborateness of this plastic somehow doesn''t fit with the blades of grass. But - again, a very good photograph</td>', 'Very nice setup, idea and light, I would just change the hose to something simpler - the elaborateness of this plastic somehow doesn''t fit with the blades of grass. But - again, a very good photograph', '2008-04-17 15:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646008, 668384, 46885, '<td valign="top">what made you cook it so tough? I mean, it looks like if it was a promising picture without all that PS overdrive...</td>', 'what made you cook it so tough? I mean, it looks like if it was a promising picture without all that PS overdrive...', '2008-04-17 15:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646012, 669168, 46885, '<td valign="top">For such dramatic set-up you needed more bold lighting or really going at it with contrast on the editing stage.</td>', 'For such dramatic set-up you needed more bold lighting or really going at it with contrast on the editing stage.', '2008-04-17 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646017, 667795, 46885, '<td valign="top">envy her bladder :) would work even better in monochrome, but is quite good nevertheless</td>', 'envy her bladder :) would work even better in monochrome, but is quite good nevertheless', '2008-04-17 15:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646020, 668966, 46885, '<td valign="top">You could have really stretched yourself and clone out the dust in the top, but hey - with a cool attitude like this, who needs sweat?</td>', 'You could have really stretched yourself and clone out the dust in the top, but hey - with a cool attitude like this, who needs sweat?', '2008-04-17 15:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646033, 668967, 46885, '<td valign="top">It could be me photographing stray dogs for two days non-stop, but I see two dog faces in 1/3 of the right edge. Funny...</td>', 'It could be me photographing stray dogs for two days non-stop, but I see two dog faces in 1/3 of the right edge. Funny...', '2008-04-17 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646088, 668801, 27475, '<td valign="top">very nice and crisp.  there''s only that blury beign thing in the bottom left corner that I find distracting.  <br/>Well done!</td>', 'very nice and crisp.  there''s only that blury beign thing in the bottom left corner that I find distracting.  Well done!', '2008-04-17 16:25:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4646177, 668396, 61971, '<td valign="top">good water action, but I think I would have preferred to have a wider crop on this so we could actually see what was going on with the ducks.</td>', 'good water action, but I think I would have preferred to have a wider crop on this so we could actually see what was going on with the ducks.', '2008-04-17 18:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646181, 668590, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but i think that if the motion had been stopped it would be a little better, the bottle also seems a little tilted and that is distracting on the composition, imo</td>', 'I like the concept, but i think that if the motion had been stopped it would be a little better, the bottle also seems a little tilted and that is distracting on the composition, imo', '2008-04-17 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646184, 668598, 61971, '<td valign="top">a pretty sunset, i feel like this is a little over sharp in points which makes it look over saturated, imo</td>', 'a pretty sunset, i feel like this is a little over sharp in points which makes it look over saturated, imo', '2008-04-17 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646190, 668653, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the green in the boat, but I feel like this would be better for me with a tighter crop from the left</td>', 'I like the green in the boat, but I feel like this would be better for me with a tighter crop from the left', '2008-04-17 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646195, 669138, 61971, '<td valign="top">it looks like a pretty fountain, I don''t know that I like the composition. It seems a little blurry to me. Like you are somewhere in between stopping the water and having that pretty long exposure of running water. jmo</td>', 'it looks like a pretty fountain, I don''t know that I like the composition. It seems a little blurry to me. Like you are somewhere in between stopping the water and having that pretty long exposure of running water. jmo', '2008-04-17 18:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646205, 668688, 61971, '<td valign="top">i like the concept. I also like the use of red in the skirt and umbrella. The light coming from the right side of the picture is a little harsh, and it keeps pulling my eye. I also feel that a composition with the whole umbrella over the top would work better, and maybe a different color shirt. Since it is wet, half of it looks a different color. Sorry for being nit picky, but I really liked the concept. jmo</td>', 'i like the concept. I also like the use of red in the skirt and umbrella. The light coming from the right side of the picture is a little harsh, and it keeps pulling my eye. I also feel that a composition with the whole umbrella over the top would work better, and maybe a different color shirt. Since it is wet, half of it looks a different color. Sorry for being nit picky, but I really liked the concept. jmo', '2008-04-17 18:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646206, 668133, 61971, '<td valign="top">This looks like a pretty setting, but the glare from the sun is distracting imo. I also feel that it is too grainy.</td>', 'This looks like a pretty setting, but the glare from the sun is distracting imo. I also feel that it is too grainy.', '2008-04-17 18:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646212, 667861, 61971, '<td valign="top">I am bumping because I have decided that you meant to go a little abstract. It almost creates an optical illusion where you can''t tell which direction it is running.</td>', 'I am bumping because I have decided that you meant to go a little abstract. It almost creates an optical illusion where you can''t tell which direction it is running.', '2008-04-17 18:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646218, 668509, 61971, '<td valign="top">I feel like this is the gatoraid moment in sports. Nice and sharp, imo a wider crop would have been nice, the bottom of her chin is cut off.</td>', 'I feel like this is the gatoraid moment in sports. Nice and sharp, imo a wider crop would have been nice, the bottom of her chin is cut off.', '2008-04-17 18:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646219, 668207, 61971, '<td valign="top">It is a neat concept, a little oof imo.</td>', 'It is a neat concept, a little oof imo.', '2008-04-17 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646236, 667861, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well observed piece of art. Good light and a wonderful painted feel to it. Good luck.</td>', 'Well observed piece of art. Good light and a wonderful painted feel to it. Good luck.', '2008-04-17 18:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646240, 668804, 8860, '<td valign="top">d l</td>', 'd l', '2008-04-17 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646257, 669076, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like this - would look good as a large print in an East End bar/restaurant. Just the title ''Tap Water'' would do, mind, and leave the rest to viewers to work out!</td>', 'I like this - would look good as a large print in an East End bar/restaurant. Just the title ''Tap Water'' would do, mind, and leave the rest to viewers to work out!', '2008-04-17 18:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646258, 669080, 8860, '<td valign="top">Definitely an engaging photo - enigmatic with some interesting texture. No need for explanation - just leave it to imagination!</td>', 'Definitely an engaging photo - enigmatic with some interesting texture. No need for explanation - just leave it to imagination!', '2008-04-17 18:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646260, 668800, 8860, '<td valign="top">A more interesting execution of the cliche water drop. This is punchy and graphical with a delectable quality through colour and clarity. I''d like to have seen a more identifiable flower form (tulip?) in the droplet and composition is bottom-heavy, but this will surely appeal to the smooth-centric voters here at DPC! You may end up with a coloured gif next to your title by the end.</td>', 'A more interesting execution of the cliche water drop. This is punchy and graphical with a delectable quality through colour and clarity. I''d like to have seen a more identifiable flower form (tulip?) in the droplet and composition is bottom-heavy, but this will surely appeal to the smooth-centric voters here at DPC! You may end up with a coloured gif next to your title by the end.', '2008-04-17 18:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646261, 669118, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed - an intriguing subject. I just wish you''d rotated to horizontal as the slope is distracting. Good DOF.</td>', 'Nicely observed - an intriguing subject. I just wish you''d rotated to horizontal as the slope is distracting. Good DOF.', '2008-04-17 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646265, 668686, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the toning here. Your processing has left a halo around the figure though, which reduces the sense of purity, but it''s still a satisfying shot to behold.</td>', 'Love the toning here. Your processing has left a halo around the figure though, which reduces the sense of purity, but it''s still a satisfying shot to behold.', '2008-04-17 18:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646268, 668232, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent viewpoint and the kind of thing I like to try myself. Compositionally it''s a tad awkward, so a squarer crop losing the path on the right may improve it.  I don''t know why you felt you needed to de-saturate. It doesn''t look bad - just a bit ominous - when in fact your shot is more humourous. Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent viewpoint and the kind of thing I like to try myself. Compositionally it''s a tad awkward, so a squarer crop losing the path on the right may improve it.  I don''t know why you felt you needed to de-saturate. It doesn''t look bad - just a bit ominous - when in fact your shot is more humourous. Good luck.', '2008-04-17 18:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646272, 668643, 8860, '<td valign="top">Over-sharpened, but an attractive subject and composition.</td>', 'Over-sharpened, but an attractive subject and composition.', '2008-04-17 18:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646278, 668695, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweet subject. Just lacking in creative engagement. Your subject is everything and, being honest, the click of the shutter in auto mode is all that''s required to achieve this. To bring a twist to this shot, I think you could;<br/>&gt; avoid centering or move further above and ''lose'' your frogs in the duckweed;<br/>&gt; get closer and lower catching their eyes in reflection with a narrow DOF;<br/>&gt; try contrasty black and white to help camouflage the subjects and give viewers some ''work'' to do.</td>', 'Sweet subject. Just lacking in creative engagement. Your subject is everything and, being honest, the click of the shutter in auto mode is all that''s required to achieve this. To bring a twist to this shot, I think you could;> avoid centering or move further above and ''lose'' your frogs in the duckweed;> get closer and lower catching their eyes in reflection with a narrow DOF;> try contrasty black and white to help camouflage the subjects and give viewers some ''work'' to do.', '2008-04-17 19:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646280, 668925, 8860, '<td valign="top">Striking abstract - like it. <br/> <br/>Some colour noise present which can be reduced by converting to LAB colour in PS and blurring channels ''a'' and/or ''b''. (Plenty of alternative methods too.)</td>', 'Striking abstract - like it.  Some colour noise present which can be reduced by converting to LAB colour in PS and blurring channels ''a'' and/or ''b''. (Plenty of alternative methods too.)', '2008-04-17 19:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646281, 669187, 8860, '<td valign="top">A well executed cliché special!</td>', 'A well executed cliché special!', '2008-04-17 19:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646286, 667525, 8860, '<td valign="top">Impressive subject but just a bit too overexposed. A Neutral Density filter would resolve this in future.</td>', 'Impressive subject but just a bit too overexposed. A Neutral Density filter would resolve this in future.', '2008-04-17 19:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646364, 669168, 31535, '<td valign="top">Wonderul idea. Your lighting is good and I like the rich blues. The one thing thats jumped out at me though is the cut off reflection. Similar to the background, try to be aware of how the foreground falls in the composition. Having said that, it didn''t stop <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=667396" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> shot from winning blue. Good job. 8 for now.</td>', 'Wonderul idea. Your lighting is good and I like the rich blues. The one thing thats jumped out at me though is the cut off reflection. Similar to the background, try to be aware of how the foreground falls in the composition. Having said that, it didn''t stop this shot from winning blue. Good job. 8 for now.', '2008-04-17 20:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646395, 668065, 61971, '<td valign="top">Eeew is right. For a pasta concept you could have done the pasta just after it gets put in the pot with the boiling water. jmo</td>', 'Eeew is right. For a pasta concept you could have done the pasta just after it gets put in the pot with the boiling water. jmo', '2008-04-17 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646399, 668519, 61971, '<td valign="top">a little too grainy for me. imo the focus should be on the water and not the background</td>', 'a little too grainy for me. imo the focus should be on the water and not the background', '2008-04-17 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646400, 669108, 61971, '<td valign="top">imo, I do not like the processing on this one</td>', 'imo, I do not like the processing on this one', '2008-04-17 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
