(4646501, 669106, 22970, '<td valign="top">Captured nicely</td>', 'Captured nicely', '2008-04-17 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646503, 668228, 22970, '<td valign="top">Creative and nicely done. I think the title would of been better as "Glass Eye" but does not take away from the photograph. Nice job!</td>', 'Creative and nicely done. I think the title would of been better as "Glass Eye" but does not take away from the photograph. Nice job!', '2008-04-17 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646506, 668653, 22970, '<td valign="top">nice point of view and composition. The boat is so green it almost makes me think this is a boat challenge as it takes over as the subject and makes the water bland. Still a good shot and deserves a good score.</td>', 'nice point of view and composition. The boat is so green it almost makes me think this is a boat challenge as it takes over as the subject and makes the water bland. Still a good shot and deserves a good score.', '2008-04-17 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646509, 667995, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple and good composition. But I feel the lighting could of been better and the focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice and simple and good composition. But I feel the lighting could of been better and the focus seems a bit soft.', '2008-04-17 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646516, 668886, 22970, '<td valign="top">The circular fisheye lens gives your photograph a good effect. Nice colors and lighting. However I think if you would of cropped the top and bottom so the the  venting did not show in the picture, your effect would of been better. I know you would of lost the houses on the hill at top and part of the dock anchor at bottom but it would of made me focus on the reflections in the water more. <br/>Still a nice shot.</td>', 'The circular fisheye lens gives your photograph a good effect. Nice colors and lighting. However I think if you would of cropped the top and bottom so the the  venting did not show in the picture, your effect would of been better. I know you would of lost the houses on the hill at top and part of the dock anchor at bottom but it would of made me focus on the reflections in the water more. Still a nice shot.', '2008-04-17 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646518, 668842, 22970, '<td valign="top">So close! Would of been a great capture with the lighting and colors if the focus would not have been off. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'So close! Would of been a great capture with the lighting and colors if the focus would not have been off. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2008-04-17 23:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646523, 669170, 22970, '<td valign="top">Woo, retina burn. Ok going to have to rest my eyes now. I see spots when I close them :P <br/>Joking aside I like the randomness of the water droplet''s and colors. Deserves a good score.</td>', 'Woo, retina burn. Ok going to have to rest my eyes now. I see spots when I close them :P Joking aside I like the randomness of the water droplet''s and colors. Deserves a good score.', '2008-04-17 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646524, 668719, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice. DOF is great along with the composition and angle. Colors complement  each other. Very good lighting and focus. Overall a very good photograph.</td>', 'Very nice. DOF is great along with the composition and angle. Colors complement  each other. Very good lighting and focus. Overall a very good photograph.', '2008-04-17 23:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646525, 669188, 70484, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking! 10</td>', 'Breathtaking! 10', '2008-04-17 23:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646527, 669184, 22970, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Water drop and ripples in the best place to show dimension and depth. I am bugged by the black stick (???) at the left-top and the shadow on the left side.</td>', 'Simple but effective. Water drop and ripples in the best place to show dimension and depth. I am bugged by the black stick (???) at the left-top and the shadow on the left side.', '2008-04-17 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646529, 669014, 22970, '<td valign="top">I see the power of the water (waves) but its over shadowed by the brightness of the green rocks. Good shot but maybe a little less saturation in the green/yellows.</td>', 'I see the power of the water (waves) but its over shadowed by the brightness of the green rocks. Good shot but maybe a little less saturation in the green/yellows.', '2008-04-17 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646536, 667541, 61971, '<td valign="top">the lighting is good, I feel like the lemon title throws me off a little, I see the lemon, but there is a lime green cast to the water. aside from that it is a hair off center</td>', 'the lighting is good, I feel like the lemon title throws me off a little, I see the lemon, but there is a lime green cast to the water. aside from that it is a hair off center', '2008-04-17 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646538, 669134, 61971, '<td valign="top">the texture in the rocks is nice. I wish the water was slightly lighter though, my eyes are pulled mostly to the rocks</td>', 'the texture in the rocks is nice. I wish the water was slightly lighter though, my eyes are pulled mostly to the rocks', '2008-04-17 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646541, 668981, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the pastels in this photo, but I feel like that tree gets in the way of a really nice view of the lake</td>', 'I love the pastels in this photo, but I feel like that tree gets in the way of a really nice view of the lake', '2008-04-17 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646542, 666967, 61971, '<td valign="top">good out of the box thinking. I wish the whole pale was in the photo. I also could have done without the loses manhood in the title. I think the picture tells a story on it''s own</td>', 'good out of the box thinking. I wish the whole pale was in the photo. I also could have done without the loses manhood in the title. I think the picture tells a story on it''s own', '2008-04-17 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646543, 667576, 61971, '<td valign="top">very pretty duck, great reflection, I like the lines through the water. imo the water is a little too bright.</td>', 'very pretty duck, great reflection, I like the lines through the water. imo the water is a little too bright.', '2008-04-17 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646544, 669158, 61971, '<td valign="top">must have been a fun day at the beach :)</td>', 'must have been a fun day at the beach :)', '2008-04-17 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646545, 668368, 61971, '<td valign="top">imo the title doesn''t fit because the water looks green. Aside from that, I would like the composition better if the turtle filled the frame at a diagonal angle.</td>', 'imo the title doesn''t fit because the water looks green. Aside from that, I would like the composition better if the turtle filled the frame at a diagonal angle.', '2008-04-17 23:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646546, 668668, 61971, '<td valign="top">good job with the nice water flow, it is kind of neat how it looks like there are sparklers in the water. imo the whole picture is a little out of focus though.</td>', 'good job with the nice water flow, it is kind of neat how it looks like there are sparklers in the water. imo the whole picture is a little out of focus though.', '2008-04-17 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646549, 668706, 61971, '<td valign="top">A great moment, I wonder what the background would have been if you were standing on that other bank, the roots seem distracting to me, you could have taken it with the river running through the background too.</td>', 'A great moment, I wonder what the background would have been if you were standing on that other bank, the roots seem distracting to me, you could have taken it with the river running through the background too.', '2008-04-17 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
