(4646854, 669095, 88523, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm....looks like an elderly womans hair...The golden water really pulls the viewer''s eye.</td>', 'Hmmmm....looks like an elderly womans hair...The golden water really pulls the viewer''s eye.', '2008-04-18 07:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646855, 669144, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love this detail, and I feel like he/she has this expression like "hey baby" That water looks so clear. I would like to say thank you btw, first pass during voting I gave this a 5, I am bumping to 8. You show me how important it is to make the time and go back for commenting. I must have been half asleep the first time I went through.</td>', 'I love this detail, and I feel like he/she has this expression like "hey baby" That water looks so clear. I would like to say thank you btw, first pass during voting I gave this a 5, I am bumping to 8. You show me how important it is to make the time and go back for commenting. I must have been half asleep the first time I went through.', '2008-04-18 07:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646856, 669160, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the bridge. I personally would prefer a different background. I like the windows in the building on the left but the building on the right has no interest for me. Maybe a vantage point from closer to the bridge? imo the unnatural color of the water that is at the bottom of the picture is a little distracting too. The processing really did make the detail in the buildings pop. It gives them a lot of texture.</td>', 'I like the bridge. I personally would prefer a different background. I like the windows in the building on the left but the building on the right has no interest for me. Maybe a vantage point from closer to the bridge? imo the unnatural color of the water that is at the bottom of the picture is a little distracting too. The processing really did make the detail in the buildings pop. It gives them a lot of texture.', '2008-04-18 07:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
