(4647251, 668629, 73981, '<td valign="top">The only 10 I gave to the challenge. It has a very fairytale feel to it (Obviously) and there isn''t 1 thing I can see that is wrong with this photo. Hopefully PP techniques etc will be shared with the rest of us so we can set out to do the same thing you''ve accomplished here. Love it!!</td>', 'The only 10 I gave to the challenge. It has a very fairytale feel to it (Obviously) and there isn''t 1 thing I can see that is wrong with this photo. Hopefully PP techniques etc will be shared with the rest of us so we can set out to do the same thing you''ve accomplished here. Love it!!', '2008-04-18 12:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4647421, 669165, 22970, '<td valign="top">Had the potential to be a good shot. But I don''t understand all the sun flares in your picture. Did you have a UV filter on your camera? It don''t look like your shooting directly into the sun. I find them very distracting and the shadow of the brush/grass on the top-left. I would of loved to see this image with smooth water allowing us to see the boat disappear under the water with contrast on the boat above the water. <br/>Wish you well in the challenge. Nice B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Had the potential to be a good shot. But I don''t understand all the sun flares in your picture. Did you have a UV filter on your camera? It don''t look like your shooting directly into the sun. I find them very distracting and the shadow of the brush/grass on the top-left. I would of loved to see this image with smooth water allowing us to see the boat disappear under the water with contrast on the boat above the water. Wish you well in the challenge. Nice B&W conversion.', '2008-04-18 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4647424, 668054, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice colors (blue water/red ball), however the subject is bland. I was looking for more creative water shots. Don''t get me wrong your picture is good technically but lacks creativity. Good picture!</td>', 'Nice colors (blue water/red ball), however the subject is bland. I was looking for more creative water shots. Don''t get me wrong your picture is good technically but lacks creativity. Good picture!', '2008-04-18 15:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
