(4648228, 669176, 22970, '<td valign="top">Well the challenge did say "Water" and we have it in this photograph. Technically good, shows how water flows over object such as the stick and has some nice broken in the background. However it just a photo of water with nothing interesting to make me want to study it. You did meet the challenge and technically you did well. I would of liked to have seen some creativity.</td>', 'Well the challenge did say "Water" and we have it in this photograph. Technically good, shows how water flows over object such as the stick and has some nice broken in the background. However it just a photo of water with nothing interesting to make me want to study it. You did meet the challenge and technically you did well. I would of liked to have seen some creativity.', '2008-04-19 02:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648229, 668126, 22970, '<td valign="top">Please take this as a critique because I''m by no means a rude commenter. I just want to tell you what I see in your photograph. <br/> <br/>Would I hang this on my wall? No! Would I have this as a wallpaper on my computer? No! and heres why, your showing me the side of a building with snow. In a challenge setting (even though the snow is pretty) your going to have to have some creativity within your shot for it to stand out. With that said I would like to offer a suggestion of what you could of done with this setting and made it an interesting photograph. IMO at-least. <br/> <br/>Your showing us to much, to much of things we don''t need to see. But there is a diamond in the rough if you look at the ice-sickles in the middle. If you would of taken a nice vertical picture of the ice-sickles from their crown down to where they touch the snow mound and given us a close-up view with detail, that would of made a nice creative and interesting photograph. <br/> <br/>I hope you found this comment helpful. Your photo is not bad it just does not offer up anything to me, as-is.</td>', 'Please take this as a critique because I''m by no means a rude commenter. I just want to tell you what I see in your photograph.  Would I hang this on my wall? No! Would I have this as a wallpaper on my computer? No! and heres why, your showing me the side of a building with snow. In a challenge setting (even though the snow is pretty) your going to have to have some creativity within your shot for it to stand out. With that said I would like to offer a suggestion of what you could of done with this setting and made it an interesting photograph. IMO at-least.  Your showing us to much, to much of things we don''t need to see. But there is a diamond in the rough if you look at the ice-sickles in the middle. If you would of taken a nice vertical picture of the ice-sickles from their crown down to where they touch the snow mound and given us a close-up view with detail, that would of made a nice creative and interesting photograph.  I hope you found this comment helpful. Your photo is not bad it just does not offer up anything to me, as-is.', '2008-04-19 02:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648230, 668950, 22970, '<td valign="top">Interesting and a nice capture. Good POV, lighting and focus. Nothing in the background that distracts me from the subject. Well taken!</td>', 'Interesting and a nice capture. Good POV, lighting and focus. Nothing in the background that distracts me from the subject. Well taken!', '2008-04-19 02:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648234, 669188, 91684, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2008-04-19 02:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648235, 669016, 91684, '<td valign="top">I love this one</td>', 'I love this one', '2008-04-19 02:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648241, 668712, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice lemon/lime drop in the water lets see bubbles shot :P<br/>You did a good job. Lighting is good along with composition. Focus is nice and you stopped the motion well. The only thing that distracts me is the grainy background. I think I could of scored it higher if the background had of been a smooth color without the grain/noise. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Nice lemon/lime drop in the water lets see bubbles shot :PYou did a good job. Lighting is good along with composition. Focus is nice and you stopped the motion well. The only thing that distracts me is the grainy background. I think I could of scored it higher if the background had of been a smooth color without the grain/noise. Still a good shot.', '2008-04-19 02:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648242, 668155, 52472, '<td valign="top">Sharp bird, smooth water... I would have cropped the bottom part. Having only water around the bird would result in a more serene picture.</td>', 'Sharp bird, smooth water... I would have cropped the bottom part. Having only water around the bird would result in a more serene picture.', '2008-04-19 02:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648244, 668653, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great subject and lighting, nice colours. The only thing which is slightly disturbing is the composition: one would like to know what the subject is looking at (eg for understanding his way of life). Anyway, great shot!</td>', 'Great subject and lighting, nice colours. The only thing which is slightly disturbing is the composition: one would like to know what the subject is looking at (eg for understanding his way of life). Anyway, great shot!', '2008-04-19 03:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648282, 667795, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great shot and a perfect advertisement! You almost convinced me. But after some consideration, I''m staying with beer.</td>', 'Great shot and a perfect advertisement! You almost convinced me. But after some consideration, I''m staying with beer.', '2008-04-19 03:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648288, 668969, 52472, '<td valign="top">These colours in the water, that''s very good stuff!</td>', 'These colours in the water, that''s very good stuff!', '2008-04-19 03:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
