(4648415, 669016, 91131, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous', '2008-04-19 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648436, 668668, 7786, '<td valign="top">This shot is a nice one with a well constructed composition. But with a little more attetion to details it can be made better. The highlighted parts where the sun shines is distracting, takin long exposures in sunlight is diffucult. An overcast day or late in the aftenoon is usually better for these kind of shots.<br/>The foreground leaves ar out of focus due to lack of DOF. Focusing closer to the foreground, about 1/3 into the picture would have created deeper DOF.</td>', 'This shot is a nice one with a well constructed composition. But with a little more attetion to details it can be made better. The highlighted parts where the sun shines is distracting, takin long exposures in sunlight is diffucult. An overcast day or late in the aftenoon is usually better for these kind of shots.The foreground leaves ar out of focus due to lack of DOF. Focusing closer to the foreground, about 1/3 into the picture would have created deeper DOF.', '2008-04-19 08:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648439, 669131, 7786, '<td valign="top">Wow, this place looks amazing. Well captured too! I need to revisit this image and see where it is taken.</td>', 'Wow, this place looks amazing. Well captured too! I need to revisit this image and see where it is taken.', '2008-04-19 08:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648443, 668698, 7786, '<td valign="top">Nice image, well captured. But I dont understand the title, what other form? Dew is water in its liquid state.</td>', 'Nice image, well captured. But I dont understand the title, what other form? Dew is water in its liquid state.', '2008-04-19 08:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648447, 668923, 7786, '<td valign="top">Its a nice image but water is hard to find here.</td>', 'Its a nice image but water is hard to find here.', '2008-04-19 08:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648451, 669004, 7786, '<td valign="top">Nice!! Well captured image and it fits the challenge better than most other images in this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Nice!! Well captured image and it fits the challenge better than most other images in this challenge. Well done.', '2008-04-19 08:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648453, 668800, 7786, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image. Creative use of water. Sharp and good attention to details.</td>', 'Brilliant image. Creative use of water. Sharp and good attention to details.', '2008-04-19 08:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648512, 669184, 83080, '<td valign="top">I love this!  It''s the most original drop shot in the bunch.  Great use of lines (literally) &amp; negative space.  It seems like such a generous DOF I look forward to seeing the settings.  Best of all, this is a well composed,  real scene rather than just a drop (and don''t get me wrong, I LOVE simple drops).  Congratulations on a great shot and I hope you do well in the voting.</td>', 'I love this!  It''s the most original drop shot in the bunch.  Great use of lines (literally) & negative space.  It seems like such a generous DOF I look forward to seeing the settings.  Best of all, this is a well composed,  real scene rather than just a drop (and don''t get me wrong, I LOVE simple drops).  Congratulations on a great shot and I hope you do well in the voting.', '2008-04-19 10:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648513, 669080, 83080, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.  Incredible abstract and what a face!  It has the feel of colored glass and it''s so rich with color and texture that I could hang it on my wall and look at it over and over again.  The only nipicky thing I might alter is the white spot along the left edge, but even with that this is awesome!  Good luck in voting and congratulations on a great shot.</td>', 'Mmmm.  Incredible abstract and what a face!  It has the feel of colored glass and it''s so rich with color and texture that I could hang it on my wall and look at it over and over again.  The only nipicky thing I might alter is the white spot along the left edge, but even with that this is awesome!  Good luck in voting and congratulations on a great shot.', '2008-04-19 10:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648514, 669126, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Great action and sharpness and definately water.  I love that the perspective also captures the kick water.  This is among my favorites inthis challenge.  (I''m always impressed with people who can butterfly well)</td>', 'Cool.  Great action and sharpness and definately water.  I love that the perspective also captures the kick water.  This is among my favorites inthis challenge.  (I''m always impressed with people who can butterfly well)', '2008-04-19 10:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648515, 668786, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cool!  very unique and interesting perspective and this is certainly one of my favorites in this challenge.  The puddle with the reflection makes a marvelous illusion.  It looks as though the water is being shot out rather than just dropped.  A squirt bottle perhaps?  I wonder if this isn''t just a touch oversharpened judging by the jagged lines particularly on the top sting of water.  In any case, it''s still a great shot and I hope you score well!</td>', 'Cool!  very unique and interesting perspective and this is certainly one of my favorites in this challenge.  The puddle with the reflection makes a marvelous illusion.  It looks as though the water is being shot out rather than just dropped.  A squirt bottle perhaps?  I wonder if this isn''t just a touch oversharpened judging by the jagged lines particularly on the top sting of water.  In any case, it''s still a great shot and I hope you score well!', '2008-04-19 10:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648519, 669188, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice.  what a classy setting.  I love the vertical feel from the reflection and the bride looks like she''s in a fairy tail.</td>', 'Nice.  what a classy setting.  I love the vertical feel from the reflection and the bride looks like she''s in a fairy tail.', '2008-04-19 10:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648525, 668653, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great composition of an interesting scene.  I also love the color.  This shot really makes me wonder about the subject and what he''s looking at.  Very emotive capture</td>', 'Great composition of an interesting scene.  I also love the color.  This shot really makes me wonder about the subject and what he''s looking at.  Very emotive capture', '2008-04-19 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648526, 669087, 83080, '<td valign="top">So many great things about this photo.  I love the way my eyes are lead around in this, both through the water and the branches.  The color is very relaxing.</td>', 'So many great things about this photo.  I love the way my eyes are lead around in this, both through the water and the branches.  The color is very relaxing.', '2008-04-19 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648532, 668197, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is where I want to be right now.  Beautiful composition.  I particularly love the sky/water contrast.  The boat seems a little soft to me, but that doesn''t matter much as it doesn''t take away from the overall placid feel you''ve captured here.</td>', 'This is where I want to be right now.  Beautiful composition.  I particularly love the sky/water contrast.  The boat seems a little soft to me, but that doesn''t matter much as it doesn''t take away from the overall placid feel you''ve captured here.', '2008-04-19 10:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648533, 668999, 83080, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept &amp; capture.  The only thing that detracts slightly for me is the post processing.  There''s some jaggedness in the details of the bird, particularly around the beak and wing edges.  Also, there is a grainy/posterized feel particularly in the waves. (keep in mind I am far from a processing expert)<br/> <br/>Still, this is among my favorite photos in this challenge and I hope you do well with the votes.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Brilliant concept & capture.  The only thing that detracts slightly for me is the post processing.  There''s some jaggedness in the details of the bird, particularly around the beak and wing edges.  Also, there is a grainy/posterized feel particularly in the waves. (keep in mind I am far from a processing expert) Still, this is among my favorite photos in this challenge and I hope you do well with the votes.  Congratulations.', '2008-04-19 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648537, 669187, 83080, '<td valign="top">Ah, I love the drop shots.  Great execution on this one.  I particularly enjoy the variety in each drop and that the middle left drop is a well centered fisheye of the flower.  I hope this does well.</td>', 'Ah, I love the drop shots.  Great execution on this one.  I particularly enjoy the variety in each drop and that the middle left drop is a well centered fisheye of the flower.  I hope this does well.', '2008-04-19 10:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648544, 668800, 83080, '<td valign="top">Excellent drop capture!  I like the way you composed this with the faucet.  I wonder if a blue background behind the refracted subject might have added some additional interesting color in the drop (but that''s just my curiosity playing with an already great shot).  Good luck, I''m sure you''re doing very well with this one.</td>', 'Excellent drop capture!  I like the way you composed this with the faucet.  I wonder if a blue background behind the refracted subject might have added some additional interesting color in the drop (but that''s just my curiosity playing with an already great shot).  Good luck, I''m sure you''re doing very well with this one.', '2008-04-19 10:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648548, 668801, 83080, '<td valign="top">The texture of the water is wonderful and this is a very interesting moment you''ve caught with the bill hitting the water.</td>', 'The texture of the water is wonderful and this is a very interesting moment you''ve caught with the bill hitting the water.', '2008-04-19 10:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648558, 668950, 83080, '<td valign="top">Classic and well captured.  I wonder what this would look like if the focal plane were on the fish rather than the fisherman?  I mean that out of curiosity rather than criticism as I haven''t tried this type of shot before.  This is a refreshing and fun entry in this challenge.</td>', 'Classic and well captured.  I wonder what this would look like if the focal plane were on the fish rather than the fisherman?  I mean that out of curiosity rather than criticism as I haven''t tried this type of shot before.  This is a refreshing and fun entry in this challenge.', '2008-04-19 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648561, 669054, 33769, '<td valign="top">my grandfather owned part of this and sold it for a dollar to his partner- AMAZING photograph!!! :) it brings back such vivid memories of sunny days and the curl of copper and steel on the floor beneath the machines... great capture of detail with the windows too ! :)</td>', 'my grandfather owned part of this and sold it for a dollar to his partner- AMAZING photograph!!! :) it brings back such vivid memories of sunny days and the curl of copper and steel on the floor beneath the machines... great capture of detail with the windows too ! :)', '2008-04-19 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648563, 668723, 83080, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Ducky!  Is this duck crying?  It just looks like a tear in the left eye :(  Well, I''d probably be crying too with such a small pond to swim in.</td>', 'Yes!  Ducky!  Is this duck crying?  It just looks like a tear in the left eye :(  Well, I''d probably be crying too with such a small pond to swim in.', '2008-04-19 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648566, 669110, 33769, '<td valign="top">dreamlike-very beautiful!! :) I love the sunlight dancing off the buildings, trees and illuminating the water dropping...  it almost looks like you could walk across the top.... very calm - nice capture! :)</td>', 'dreamlike-very beautiful!! :) I love the sunlight dancing off the buildings, trees and illuminating the water dropping...  it almost looks like you could walk across the top.... very calm - nice capture! :)', '2008-04-19 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648573, 667592, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the ''person in water'' shots.  I like the way the DOF blurs out her body to contrast the dark water.  It almost makes her head look disembodied, which creeps my wife out but I like it.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the ''person in water'' shots.  I like the way the DOF blurs out her body to contrast the dark water.  It almost makes her head look disembodied, which creeps my wife out but I like it.', '2008-04-19 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648578, 668972, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great waves, particularly with such interesting colors (that I''m very curious about), and I love the detail in the ball.</td>', 'Great waves, particularly with such interesting colors (that I''m very curious about), and I love the detail in the ball.', '2008-04-19 10:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648579, 669112, 83080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette, texture, &amp; overall composition.  When I read the title I thought, "but that''s not a loon".  The water certainly is golden though.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette, texture, & overall composition.  When I read the title I thought, "but that''s not a loon".  The water certainly is golden though.', '2008-04-19 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648581, 669076, 83080, '<td valign="top">What an interesting abstract.  Great selection of backgrounds to create these flowing lines.</td>', 'What an interesting abstract.  Great selection of backgrounds to create these flowing lines.', '2008-04-19 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648585, 668340, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture!! inspirational! :) I love the tonal range you chose! :)</td>', 'beautiful capture!! inspirational! :) I love the tonal range you chose! :)', '2008-04-19 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648586, 669118, 33769, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful !! :)</td>', 'Very very beautiful !! :)', '2008-04-19 10:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648587, 669169, 83080, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy following the lines through this picture with so many interesting details.</td>', 'I really enjoy following the lines through this picture with so many interesting details.', '2008-04-19 10:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648588, 669122, 33769, '<td valign="top">dream-like-and amazing; hope this one does well! :)</td>', 'dream-like-and amazing; hope this one does well! :)', '2008-04-19 10:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648589, 669188, 33769, '<td valign="top">WOW :)</td>', 'WOW :)', '2008-04-19 10:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648594, 668649, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and thanks for adding the person for perspective.  I would have totally misjudged it without that (although the trees do look rather small way up there:)</td>', 'Nice composition and thanks for adding the person for perspective.  I would have totally misjudged it without that (although the trees do look rather small way up there:)', '2008-04-19 10:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648609, 668983, 83080, '<td valign="top">That''s a very satisfying texture in the refraction.  Very smart to backlight it like that with no distracting reflections.</td>', 'That''s a very satisfying texture in the refraction.  Very smart to backlight it like that with no distracting reflections.', '2008-04-19 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648612, 668214, 83080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro.  The water is a great touch to this well detailed capture.</td>', 'Wonderful macro.  The water is a great touch to this well detailed capture.', '2008-04-19 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648614, 669008, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice setting &amp; capture and I like that you captured so many forms of water.</td>', 'Nice setting & capture and I like that you captured so many forms of water.', '2008-04-19 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648651, 669170, 83080, '<td valign="top">Well this is certianly a fun shot!  The largest drops on the top left are slightly too big for the dof IMHO and this could use a little cloning/healing in spots given the advanced editing.  I very much like the variety made by some of the oblong drops.  My first impression of the small drop was that they are too cluttered, but it also adds depth when I allow myself to look at it the right way.</td>', 'Well this is certianly a fun shot!  The largest drops on the top left are slightly too big for the dof IMHO and this could use a little cloning/healing in spots given the advanced editing.  I very much like the variety made by some of the oblong drops.  My first impression of the small drop was that they are too cluttered, but it also adds depth when I allow myself to look at it the right way.', '2008-04-19 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648654, 668330, 83080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  This shot makes me want to jump in and look around.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  This shot makes me want to jump in and look around.', '2008-04-19 11:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648665, 668992, 83080, '<td valign="top">Love the textures, detail, and particularly the contrast with the lighter plants.</td>', 'Love the textures, detail, and particularly the contrast with the lighter plants.', '2008-04-19 11:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648683, 669058, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition overall, but there is something about the border between the near shore and the water that looks very unnatural to me and it feels a bit grainy for me, particularly in the river.  Actually all of those things seem to be in the bottom half of the picture.  The falls and the far rockface look great to me.</td>', 'I like the colors and composition overall, but there is something about the border between the near shore and the water that looks very unnatural to me and it feels a bit grainy for me, particularly in the river.  Actually all of those things seem to be in the bottom half of the picture.  The falls and the far rockface look great to me.', '2008-04-19 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648687, 668643, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  This is such a great pattern.  It feels a little oof and the light seems a bit harsh for me.  Still, it''s a wonderfully unique capture.</td>', 'Very interesting.  This is such a great pattern.  It feels a little oof and the light seems a bit harsh for me.  Still, it''s a wonderfully unique capture.', '2008-04-19 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648690, 669131, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great color, detail and composition.  This is one of those shots that really invites me in to look around.</td>', 'Great color, detail and composition.  This is one of those shots that really invites me in to look around.', '2008-04-19 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648693, 668984, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like your pattern for this very much.  Excellent sharpness and DOF.  This drop looks like it should be reproduced for a set of chess pawns :)</td>', 'I like your pattern for this very much.  Excellent sharpness and DOF.  This drop looks like it should be reproduced for a set of chess pawns :)', '2008-04-19 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648873, 668228, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a fun entertaining shot.  Fantastic expression.  Could be a tad brighter but it''s an 8 from me.</td>', 'What a fun entertaining shot.  Fantastic expression.  Could be a tad brighter but it''s an 8 from me.', '2008-04-19 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648882, 668667, 55838, '<td valign="top">Such a fantastic swirl in the water.  The little fish is a bit too dark to really make this pic pop as much as some of the past versions of leaping goldfish but I love the swirl!</td>', 'Such a fantastic swirl in the water.  The little fish is a bit too dark to really make this pic pop as much as some of the past versions of leaping goldfish but I love the swirl!', '2008-04-19 14:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648885, 668054, 55838, '<td valign="top">So how many "Marco...Polar" comments have you received so far?  : )  Nice color.</td>', 'So how many "Marco...Polar" comments have you received so far?  : )  Nice color.', '2008-04-19 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648887, 668999, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is so dynamic and cool! 8</td>', 'This is so dynamic and cool! 8', '2008-04-19 14:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648888, 668925, 55838, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous abstract.  Love the diagonal too.</td>', 'Gorgeous abstract.  Love the diagonal too.', '2008-04-19 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4648912, 668973, 42013, '<td valign="top">good timing! I like the frozen water-although it wasnt the first thing that caught my eye.</td>', 'good timing! I like the frozen water-although it wasnt the first thing that caught my eye.', '2008-04-19 15:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648914, 668804, 42013, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool find. Feels like it is a little cramped on the LH side though.</td>', 'Pretty cool find. Feels like it is a little cramped on the LH side though.', '2008-04-19 15:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648915, 669113, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in the water--I like the border, well done.</td>', 'Nice tones in the water--I like the border, well done.', '2008-04-19 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648916, 668706, 42013, '<td valign="top">Water feels secondary to me here but I really like the yellow line transcribing the picture. Wish the far bank wasn''t so jumbly.</td>', 'Water feels secondary to me here but I really like the yellow line transcribing the picture. Wish the far bank wasn''t so jumbly.', '2008-04-19 15:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648917, 669118, 42013, '<td valign="top">Delightful pic, wish it had about 50% less of the white/light reflections. Particularly on the lower left. Still very nice.</td>', 'Delightful pic, wish it had about 50% less of the white/light reflections. Particularly on the lower left. Still very nice.', '2008-04-19 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648918, 668709, 42013, '<td valign="top">The power of water captured.</td>', 'The power of water captured.', '2008-04-19 15:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648919, 668753, 42013, '<td valign="top">Pretty pinwheel flowers. The water drops are a nice touch.</td>', 'Pretty pinwheel flowers. The water drops are a nice touch.', '2008-04-19 15:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648920, 668951, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF. Does seem like his feathers are a little gray--when I expect them to be lighter.</td>', 'I like the DOF. Does seem like his feathers are a little gray--when I expect them to be lighter.', '2008-04-19 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648922, 669099, 42013, '<td valign="top">Don''t I wish ;) Good range of exposure and detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Don''t I wish ;) Good range of exposure and detail in the shadows.', '2008-04-19 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648924, 668989, 42013, '<td valign="top">Strange DOF, lensbaby??? It look like a ladder, just waiting to be climbed.</td>', 'Strange DOF, lensbaby??? It look like a ladder, just waiting to be climbed.', '2008-04-19 15:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648925, 668817, 42013, '<td valign="top">Pretty reflections/rings.</td>', 'Pretty reflections/rings.', '2008-04-19 15:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648928, 669012, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the muted tones. It ''feels'' a little askew, not sure why.</td>', 'I like the muted tones. It ''feels'' a little askew, not sure why.', '2008-04-19 15:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648929, 668643, 42013, '<td valign="top">Like a minature chorus line. Nice stars on the reflection.</td>', 'Like a minature chorus line. Nice stars on the reflection.', '2008-04-19 15:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648931, 668667, 42013, '<td valign="top">How many takes?? ;) Must be inverted... I''ll check back.</td>', 'How many takes?? ;) Must be inverted... I''ll check back.', '2008-04-19 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648990, 668801, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. The water makes this shot and you having the focus spot-on on the ripples in the water. I like how the DOF, in-front of and behind the area of interest fades the water out of focus. Nice colors and good detail. I may have named it the "taste tester" or "taking a sip". Good shot.</td>', 'Nicely captured. The water makes this shot and you having the focus spot-on on the ripples in the water. I like how the DOF, in-front of and behind the area of interest fades the water out of focus. Nice colors and good detail. I may have named it the "taste tester" or "taking a sip". Good shot.', '2008-04-19 17:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648995, 669008, 22970, '<td valign="top">The colors are amazing. Everything seems to flow together in harmony with this photo. You have three great elements, the beacon light, a nice body of water, and then wonderful mountain range topped with snow. One of my top scores of the challenge so far. Good luck!</td>', 'The colors are amazing. Everything seems to flow together in harmony with this photo. You have three great elements, the beacon light, a nice body of water, and then wonderful mountain range topped with snow. One of my top scores of the challenge so far. Good luck!', '2008-04-19 17:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4648997, 668527, 22970, '<td valign="top">Other may view this differently but a small subject taken with a fisheye lens just doesn''t do it for me. Everything seems crowded and busy. Not a bad shot just not the right lens, IMO. I wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Other may view this differently but a small subject taken with a fisheye lens just doesn''t do it for me. Everything seems crowded and busy. Not a bad shot just not the right lens, IMO. I wish you well in the challenge.', '2008-04-19 17:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649006, 667864, 22970, '<td valign="top">The focus is nice along with the subjects. Seems to have a few hot-spots each of the geese but nothing major. I don''t know why you went with B/W with this tone, it makes me wonder what the color version looked like. Overall an nice photo.</td>', 'The focus is nice along with the subjects. Seems to have a few hot-spots each of the geese but nothing major. I don''t know why you went with B/W with this tone, it makes me wonder what the color version looked like. Overall an nice photo.', '2008-04-19 17:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649008, 666967, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think your stretching it a little with this shot. IMO, this does not represent water or at-least from your cameras point of view. Maybe taken with water be predominantly introduced into the picture but as-is it just doesn''t work for me for this challenge. As for the photograph; nice focus but the lighting is harsh. Looks more like a snap shot that a planed photograph. I wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'I think your stretching it a little with this shot. IMO, this does not represent water or at-least from your cameras point of view. Maybe taken with water be predominantly introduced into the picture but as-is it just doesn''t work for me for this challenge. As for the photograph; nice focus but the lighting is harsh. Looks more like a snap shot that a planed photograph. I wish you the best in the challenge.', '2008-04-19 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649010, 669081, 22970, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice but you know for a shot like this to be successful you have to stop the motion and you didn''t do it. Your lighting just wasn''t fast enough. However I do find the water pattern on top of the balloon interesting so not all is lost. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Colors are nice but you know for a shot like this to be successful you have to stop the motion and you didn''t do it. Your lighting just wasn''t fast enough. However I do find the water pattern on top of the balloon interesting so not all is lost. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2008-04-19 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649014, 668925, 22970, '<td valign="top">I just don''t feel a connection here. I see a lot of boken and a plain of water with some nice texture and reflections. But not enough to hold my attention. Seems that your picture has a far amount of noise.<br/>Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'I just don''t feel a connection here. I see a lot of boken and a plain of water with some nice texture and reflections. But not enough to hold my attention. Seems that your picture has a far amount of noise.Wish you well in the challenge.', '2008-04-19 17:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649026, 668972, 36382, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and calm feel to this picture. 9</td>', 'Beautiful colors and calm feel to this picture. 9', '2008-04-19 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649083, 669111, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 5/6/5 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/5 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 5.8 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: -</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 5/6/5 Composition/perspective/manner: 7/6/5 Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 Presentation: 6 Total: 5.8 Vote: 6  Remarks: -', '2008-04-19 18:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649098, 669149, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 4/5/5 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 <br/>Presentation: 5 <br/>Total: 5.6 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: a magical subject which benefits greatly from the wisp of illuminated spray above its cusp. I''ve taken this image into PS and flipped it horizontally to place the darker tones (the weight) to the right. I proceeded to crop two thirds of the area above the wisp and approx. one third of the waterfall, between rock and margin. I''d consider the same experiment, just to see what gives.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/7/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 4/5/5 Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 Presentation: 5 Total: 5.6 Vote: 6  Remarks: a magical subject which benefits greatly from the wisp of illuminated spray above its cusp. I''ve taken this image into PS and flipped it horizontally to place the darker tones (the weight) to the right. I proceeded to crop two thirds of the area above the wisp and approx. one third of the waterfall, between rock and margin. I''d consider the same experiment, just to see what gives.', '2008-04-19 19:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649115, 669187, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great prop idea -- I''ll probably try this myself :-)</td>', 'Great prop idea -- I''ll probably try this myself :-)', '2008-04-19 19:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649128, 669112, 76481, '<td valign="top">the water here looks great, this should be in the top 5 hopefully!</td>', 'the water here looks great, this should be in the top 5 hopefully!', '2008-04-19 20:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649136, 669110, 9462, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t so obvious seeing the water in this image. It appears to just be a pattern on the wall. The overall softening effect it a bit too dramatic.</td>', 'It wasn''t so obvious seeing the water in this image. It appears to just be a pattern on the wall. The overall softening effect it a bit too dramatic.', '2008-04-19 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649137, 668363, 9462, '<td valign="top">I see a kangaroo w/ wings!</td>', 'I see a kangaroo w/ wings!', '2008-04-19 20:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649138, 669119, 9462, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened for my taste. The edge of the water looks too separated from the sand.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened for my taste. The edge of the water looks too separated from the sand.', '2008-04-19 20:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649164, 669188, 9462, '<td valign="top">Lovely<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670651" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Lovely', '2008-04-19 20:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649168, 669080, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/5/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/-/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:8/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.1 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: a multi-tiered whirlpool of drawn colour and tone, kempt by wisps and disturbed by shafts of exquisite light. Scale-like patterns are both forming and dissolving, not without direction and definition, while a myriad of  lines appear as drawn funnels of a gaseous whole, exhibiting sectional patterns in flux. A slate middle ground overlays much of the image, except where the most gorgeous cyans shine through suggesting a virtual space underlying the background. Where the motion becomes chaotic, it is imbued as if with blood, writhing and rising from an ambiguity of somber, muddied tones forward, toward the viewer, falling to air.<br/> <br/>A less ambiguous minutia appears to be figurative, as an Easter egg that looks like a worm or a portion of a thin branch bathing in twilight. I''d say "hurrah", if only there was another image like this one (or several) as part of a larger exhibit that would give the one in front of me a context. <br/> <br/>As it is, I cannot, in good conscience, attempt to assign a value to this photo that isn''t quite arbitrary.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/5/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/-/6 Aesthetics/Technical:8/6 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.1 Vote: 6  Remarks: a multi-tiered whirlpool of drawn colour and tone, kempt by wisps and disturbed by shafts of exquisite light. Scale-like patterns are both forming and dissolving, not without direction and definition, while a myriad of  lines appear as drawn funnels of a gaseous whole, exhibiting sectional patterns in flux. A slate middle ground overlays much of the image, except where the most gorgeous cyans shine through suggesting a virtual space underlying the background. Where the motion becomes chaotic, it is imbued as if with blood, writhing and rising from an ambiguity of somber, muddied tones forward, toward the viewer, falling to air. A less ambiguous minutia appears to be figurative, as an Easter egg that looks like a worm or a portion of a thin branch bathing in twilight. I''d say "hurrah", if only there was another image like this one (or several) as part of a larger exhibit that would give the one in front of me a context.  As it is, I cannot, in good conscience, attempt to assign a value to this photo that isn''t quite arbitrary.', '2008-04-19 21:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649169, 668987, 9462, '<td valign="top">This is really nice but a dramatic sky and a lone figure would''ve really made for a more interesting image.</td>', 'This is really nice but a dramatic sky and a lone figure would''ve really made for a more interesting image.', '2008-04-19 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649276, 668966, 88465, '<td valign="top">A charming lack of sharpness</td>', 'A charming lack of sharpness', '2008-04-19 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649309, 668751, 86379, '<td valign="top">love everything about this....the composition, the sharpness, the blue dish...great job.</td>', 'love everything about this....the composition, the sharpness, the blue dish...great job.', '2008-04-19 23:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649310, 668574, 86379, '<td valign="top">really nice shot...love the skyline. good composition and overall sharpness.</td>', 'really nice shot...love the skyline. good composition and overall sharpness.', '2008-04-19 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
