(4650391, 669183, 10818, '<td valign="top">That looks great, quite original and well done.</td>', 'That looks great, quite original and well done.', '2008-04-20 22:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650392, 669182, 10818, '<td valign="top">Old and worn dock is fantastic, super scene.  Such a beautiful day, great colors.</td>', 'Old and worn dock is fantastic, super scene.  Such a beautiful day, great colors.', '2008-04-20 22:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650393, 669162, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the sky is a bit overexposed though, would have been good to see the detail in the top right.</td>', 'Nice shot, the sky is a bit overexposed though, would have been good to see the detail in the top right.', '2008-04-20 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650394, 668686, 41357, '<td valign="top">brilliant -10 (I have been guessing all week who''s picture is that, and I''ve narrowed the list to 5 DPC members (my guess starts with a G) but I will soon find out.</td>', 'brilliant -10 (I have been guessing all week who''s picture is that, and I''ve narrowed the list to 5 DPC members (my guess starts with a G) but I will soon find out.', '2008-04-20 22:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650396, 668649, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is really cool.  It as amazing how the mountain breaks off in 90 degree angles.  To the right it almost looks like a garage door.</td>', 'That is really cool.  It as amazing how the mountain breaks off in 90 degree angles.  To the right it almost looks like a garage door.', '2008-04-20 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650398, 668980, 10818, '<td valign="top">I have never seen waterfalls off plants like that.  Its gorgeous, wonderful shot.</td>', 'I have never seen waterfalls off plants like that.  Its gorgeous, wonderful shot.', '2008-04-20 22:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650399, 668999, 87252, '<td valign="top">Incredible - wow.</td>', 'Incredible - wow.', '2008-04-20 22:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650402, 669165, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the .. comment, not really sure what happened there! I really like the composition in this, the fact that there is "no duck" actually makes this shot more interesting I think, I spent about 2 minutes looking for it (simple minds simple pleasures)!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-21 19:49:12.</i></td>', 'Sorry for the .. comment, not really sure what happened there! I really like the composition in this, the fact that there is "no duck" actually makes this shot more interesting I think, I spent about 2 minutes looking for it (simple minds simple pleasures)!', '2008-04-20 22:47:56.000000', '2008-04-21 20:49:12.000000', 1),
(4650404, 668925, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow, incredible, I hope this does well.</td>', 'Wow, incredible, I hope this does well.', '2008-04-20 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650406, 669018, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the water and the splash.  I''m just not sure about the lemon.  I feel it should be sharper.</td>', 'I like the look of the water and the splash.  I''m just not sure about the lemon.  I feel it should be sharper.', '2008-04-20 22:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650409, 668643, 92561, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2008-04-20 22:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650410, 668719, 10818, '<td valign="top">The focus is amazing, from the rocks to the mountaintops.  What a fabulous scene.  The color looks a bit strange, not sure why.</td>', 'The focus is amazing, from the rocks to the mountaintops.  What a fabulous scene.  The color looks a bit strange, not sure why.', '2008-04-20 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650415, 668771, 36382, '<td valign="top">I do like the colors here.  I feel a bit frustrated that I can''t work out exactly what it is I''m looking at.  There seems to be too much information for an abstract, but not enough for me to work out what it is.  Just my own personal opinion.  I do like the patterns and the metallic feel.</td>', 'I do like the colors here.  I feel a bit frustrated that I can''t work out exactly what it is I''m looking at.  There seems to be too much information for an abstract, but not enough for me to work out what it is.  Just my own personal opinion.  I do like the patterns and the metallic feel.', '2008-04-20 22:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4650417, 667795, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am going to get a glass of water now, I feel a bit flushed.  :)<br/>Great shot.</td>', 'I am going to get a glass of water now, I feel a bit flushed.  :)Great shot.', '2008-04-20 22:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
