(4651012, 668686, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lesley - I didn''t vote in this challenge - but you have once again produced a wonderful, fascinating image.<br/> <br/>There is an almost other worldiness to this like some sort of benevolent extra terrestial is peering in fascination into our world. The figure is clear - but indistinct at the same time, which adds to the overall image wonderfully.<br/> <br/>Another magnificent image.<br/> <br/>p.s. the ''acid'' effect is perfect for this shot.</td>', 'Lesley - I didn''t vote in this challenge - but you have once again produced a wonderful, fascinating image. There is an almost other worldiness to this like some sort of benevolent extra terrestial is peering in fascination into our world. The figure is clear - but indistinct at the same time, which adds to the overall image wonderfully. Another magnificent image. p.s. the ''acid'' effect is perfect for this shot.', '2008-04-21 05:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
