(4651034, 668207, 89341, '<td valign="top">When I initially saw the picture I was hovering around the 4/5 mark but upped that to 6 as I liked the concept and it''s originality.<br/> <br/>I agree with other comments that there it lacks clarity to give it a higher score (IMHO) The yellow bit at the bottom is a little distracting, maybe some burning would bring that down or maybe a tighter crop cutting out most of the yellow thing and the very top leaf ... that would also remove the most oof parts.<br/> <br/>The bits floating in the water don''t help either, though nothing you can do about that!</td>', 'When I initially saw the picture I was hovering around the 4/5 mark but upped that to 6 as I liked the concept and it''s originality. I agree with other comments that there it lacks clarity to give it a higher score (IMHO) The yellow bit at the bottom is a little distracting, maybe some burning would bring that down or maybe a tighter crop cutting out most of the yellow thing and the very top leaf ... that would also remove the most oof parts. The bits floating in the water don''t help either, though nothing you can do about that!', '2008-04-21 06:38:38.000000', NULL, 0),
