(4651107, 668800, 66597, '<td valign="top">Oliver, you are really on a roll lately. You smashed your dream score out of the water I see, no pun intended. This is a very interesting shot. The tulip almost looks like it is in a mirror instead of a refracted drop. I don''t think the refracted drop looks odd at all, though the tiny stem portion coming out of the faucet does give me pause. It''s so minute that it doesn''t detract, however.</td>', 'Oliver, you are really on a roll lately. You smashed your dream score out of the water I see, no pun intended. This is a very interesting shot. The tulip almost looks like it is in a mirror instead of a refracted drop. I don''t think the refracted drop looks odd at all, though the tiny stem portion coming out of the faucet does give me pause. It''s so minute that it doesn''t detract, however.', '2008-04-21 08:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651114, 668228, 38032, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of myself. But I could never grow such a good beard.  Well done.</td>', 'This reminds me of myself. But I could never grow such a good beard.  Well done.', '2008-04-21 08:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
