(4651126, 669112, 66597, '<td valign="top">Neil, this is a beautiful photo that did quite well in a very, very tough competition. The water looks absolutely golden! I think the only issue may be the DOF - the OOF area in the back area of the water draws my eye away from the subject a bit in this case. By the way, I''m assuming you didn''t mean to add "military" as one of your galleries in this.</td>', 'Neil, this is a beautiful photo that did quite well in a very, very tough competition. The water looks absolutely golden! I think the only issue may be the DOF - the OOF area in the back area of the water draws my eye away from the subject a bit in this case. By the way, I''m assuming you didn''t mean to add "military" as one of your galleries in this.', '2008-04-21 08:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
