(4651167, 669018, 30049, '<td valign="top">Just read your comments...you really shouldn''t be such an optimist!  :-D  Looks like it did pretty well for you overall.  One thing that probably dinged the score on this (was mentioned in several comments) was the lemon.  Looking at the shot overall it appears to me that an overly healthy dose of NI (or some other noise reduction tool) was applied.  Yes, no?<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Congrats on a new image in your PB lineup.  :-)</td>', 'Just read your comments...you really shouldn''t be such an optimist!  :-D  Looks like it did pretty well for you overall.  One thing that probably dinged the score on this (was mentioned in several comments) was the lemon.  Looking at the shot overall it appears to me that an overly healthy dose of NI (or some other noise reduction tool) was applied.  Yes, no? Anyway.  Congrats on a new image in your PB lineup.  :-)', '2008-04-21 09:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
