(4651390, 668196, 68947, '<td valign="top">You have such a talent in terms of seeing a very "artsy" style of shot!  There are a lot of people in here who truly appreciate and love this type of "eye" for shots like this.  Keep up your "vision" from behind your lens because DPC''s tastes have a certain "flavor" to their preferences thus far, BUT......that''s slowly changing now!  I see it coming!  Please enter this in some of the other sites too! PUHHHLEEEEZZZZE! :)</td>', 'You have such a talent in terms of seeing a very "artsy" style of shot!  There are a lot of people in here who truly appreciate and love this type of "eye" for shots like this.  Keep up your "vision" from behind your lens because DPC''s tastes have a certain "flavor" to their preferences thus far, BUT......that''s slowly changing now!  I see it coming!  Please enter this in some of the other sites too! PUHHHLEEEEZZZZE! :)', '2008-04-21 11:06:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651399, 669122, 30982, '<td valign="top">You are a master at conveying texture.  Not just showing what it looks like, but conveying how it feels.</td>', 'You are a master at conveying texture.  Not just showing what it looks like, but conveying how it feels.', '2008-04-21 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651409, 668196, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the spotlights formed by the little droplets concentrating the sunlight on to the leaves.  I have a shot somewhere on my hard drive that''s rather similar to this but not quite as rich and lovely.</td>', 'I like the spotlights formed by the little droplets concentrating the sunlight on to the leaves.  I have a shot somewhere on my hard drive that''s rather similar to this but not quite as rich and lovely.', '2008-04-21 11:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
