(4651571, 668800, 39427, '<td valign="top">very, very well done.</td>', 'very, very well done.', '2008-04-21 12:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651600, 669126, 72252, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say that the scoring system here is a mystery to me.  Your photo should have finished at the top of the list, for so many obvious reasons.  Scoring on your photo and others I''ve liked for their expertise and artistic value is all over the place; it makes no sense to me.  <br/>I''m disappointed in my own scores too, although they aren''t in the same ball park as yours, or the others I''ve commented on here.  I''ve decided to quit DPC after a year and a half of this kind of negativity and just take pictures for my own satisfaction... good, bad, or otherwise.<br/>Best of luct to you in your future work, for what it''s worth, I think it''s outstanding.<br/>Frank</td>', 'Just wanted to say that the scoring system here is a mystery to me.  Your photo should have finished at the top of the list, for so many obvious reasons.  Scoring on your photo and others I''ve liked for their expertise and artistic value is all over the place; it makes no sense to me.  I''m disappointed in my own scores too, although they aren''t in the same ball park as yours, or the others I''ve commented on here.  I''ve decided to quit DPC after a year and a half of this kind of negativity and just take pictures for my own satisfaction... good, bad, or otherwise.Best of luct to you in your future work, for what it''s worth, I think it''s outstanding.Frank', '2008-04-21 13:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
