(4651799, 668817, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the duck. I would like to see a little more light on its face. Perhaps a little dodging (soft light brush in white) would take care of that. But the point of the shot is the water, and I love the water. I wonder if you desaturated it. The rings and distorted reflections are what I like best.</td>', 'Nice detail in the duck. I would like to see a little more light on its face. Perhaps a little dodging (soft light brush in white) would take care of that. But the point of the shot is the water, and I love the water. I wonder if you desaturated it. The rings and distorted reflections are what I like best.', '2008-04-21 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651807, 669080, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract. I love the colors, light, and ripples. And the threads throughout really make it, IMO, giving it definition.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract. I love the colors, light, and ripples. And the threads throughout really make it, IMO, giving it definition.', '2008-04-21 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
