(4652482, 668521, 87751, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the nice feedback.  I do wish I had taken more shots with different ISO, shutter speed and aperture settings.  It was kind of dark and grey that day, but I think I could have stopped the action with a slower shutter speed and gotten something slightly less grainy.  May try to recreate this one, just to keep learning.<br/> <br/>Can I just say how much I love DPChallenge and all the supportive and inspiring folks here?  This is just what I needed to get me and my camera working together regularly.  I enjoy voting and commenting as much as getting feedback on my own work.  Well...almost as much.  :-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks to all for the nice feedback.  I do wish I had taken more shots with different ISO, shutter speed and aperture settings.  It was kind of dark and grey that day, but I think I could have stopped the action with a slower shutter speed and gotten something slightly less grainy.  May try to recreate this one, just to keep learning. Can I just say how much I love DPChallenge and all the supportive and inspiring folks here?  This is just what I needed to get me and my camera working together regularly.  I enjoy voting and commenting as much as getting feedback on my own work.  Well...almost as much.  :-) ', '2008-04-21 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
