(4652516, 669118, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am adding this to my favorites.  Check this out, tell me it''s not creepy.<br/>The leaf part pointing at 10 AM is the guys nose, he is pointed toward the leaf.<br/>The leaf part at 9AM is the guys mouth,  below it is the well pronounced chin and neck.<br/>Then to top it all off, he is wearing a V-neck coat or shirt.<br/>Maybe I am crazy, but that is just so weird.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am adding this to my favorites.  Check this out, tell me it''s not creepy.The leaf part pointing at 10 AM is the guys nose, he is pointed toward the leaf.The leaf part at 9AM is the guys mouth,  below it is the well pronounced chin and neck.Then to top it all off, he is wearing a V-neck coat or shirt.Maybe I am crazy, but that is just so weird. ', '2008-04-22 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
