(4655106, 668650, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the roots.  In fact, those would be my choice as the main focus of the shot.  In that respect, I''d crop about a third off the top - give the railing some room to breath but crop above that.  Right now, the bridge draws my eye first - if you crop the top a bit, my eye is drawn more toward the water and the exposed roots.  And I really like whatever it is you did with processing on this one.  Nice soft gentle tones and colors which suit this well.</td>', 'I love the roots.  In fact, those would be my choice as the main focus of the shot.  In that respect, I''d crop about a third off the top - give the railing some room to breath but crop above that.  Right now, the bridge draws my eye first - if you crop the top a bit, my eye is drawn more toward the water and the exposed roots.  And I really like whatever it is you did with processing on this one.  Nice soft gentle tones and colors which suit this well.', '2008-04-23 10:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655173, 669169, 35357, '<td valign="top">d00d, sweet!</td>', 'd00d, sweet!', '2008-04-23 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4655229, 669150, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by laurie241:</b></div><hr/><i> this sky is amazing...and the little rocks at the bottom of the shot add so much to it. nice job! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Those little rocks are actually floating pieces of ice, the thaw had begun...and the buds were popping up all over.</td>', 'Originally posted by laurie241: this sky is amazing...and the little rocks at the bottom of the shot add so much to it. nice job!   Those little rocks are actually floating pieces of ice, the thaw had begun...and the buds were popping up all over.', '2008-04-23 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
