(4655348, 667506, 45651, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge but I would have given your crop outtake a higher score than your posted image, I like the natural skin tones better then the blue skin of the submitted image. Supper image and idea. In fact I am even leaning more toward the full image with all the flowing hair over the crop. Probably would have been a 7 or 8 for me.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge but I would have given your crop outtake a higher score than your posted image, I like the natural skin tones better then the blue skin of the submitted image. Supper image and idea. In fact I am even leaning more toward the full image with all the flowing hair over the crop. Probably would have been a 7 or 8 for me.', '2008-04-23 12:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
