(4657755, 669160, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think I walked over that bridge (20 years ago!) it certainly made me think of Tampere when I first saw this photo, and if that''s where you''re from, I guess I was right. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-24 20:19:18.</i></td>', 'I think I walked over that bridge (20 years ago!) it certainly made me think of Tampere when I first saw this photo, and if that''s where you''re from, I guess I was right. ;-)', '2008-04-24 20:28:28.000000', '2008-04-24 21:19:18.000000', 0),
(4657920, 668925, 55838, '<td valign="top">The color noise really didn''t bother me during voting although, now that I''ve read the comments and I''m looking for it, I agree that the shot would be a bit stronger without it.  Still...this shot is way underrated.  Very nice.  From one of your nine 8''s.</td>', 'The color noise really didn''t bother me during voting although, now that I''ve read the comments and I''m looking for it, I agree that the shot would be a bit stronger without it.  Still...this shot is way underrated.  Very nice.  From one of your nine 8''s.', '2008-04-24 21:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
