(4660286, 669169, 87278, '<td valign="top">Congrats on te placing. We have a saying in India that says that water from clouds decsend on mountain peaks and run thru the plains to join the sea ultimately. Your picture captures very well all the elements involved in this eco cycle and esp. the last leg of the journey very well.</td>', 'Congrats on te placing. We have a saying in India that says that water from clouds decsend on mountain peaks and run thru the plains to join the sea ultimately. Your picture captures very well all the elements involved in this eco cycle and esp. the last leg of the journey very well.', '2008-04-26 13:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
