(4663151, 669160, 33769, '<td valign="top">WOW- this is -beautiful- and amazing, the reflections on the water are outstanding and the sky is just...so stormy and breath-taking :)</td>', 'WOW- this is -beautiful- and amazing, the reflections on the water are outstanding and the sky is just...so stormy and breath-taking :)', '2008-04-28 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4664845, 668448, 87808, '<td valign="top">I just loved this shot, I love the warm gold tones you have here and the perfect circles, I gave you a 9.</td>', 'I just loved this shot, I love the warm gold tones you have here and the perfect circles, I gave you a 9.', '2008-04-29 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4664863, 669149, 87808, '<td valign="top">Holy Crap you got a great score and comment from Zeus!!!<br/> <br/>I have to say, this should have scored higher.  It is one of the most beautiful nature shots around on here.  The emotion that you get from looking at it is outstanding.  The delicate mist, the smoothness of the rocks and the round curves that lead your eye.  The sheer force of the water pounding down and shaping everything that it touches over the years.  The colours are muted but so enriching. <br/> <br/>I wish I could go there!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Holy Crap you got a great score and comment from Zeus!!! I have to say, this should have scored higher.  It is one of the most beautiful nature shots around on here.  The emotion that you get from looking at it is outstanding.  The delicate mist, the smoothness of the rocks and the round curves that lead your eye.  The sheer force of the water pounding down and shaping everything that it touches over the years.  The colours are muted but so enriching.  I wish I could go there!! ', '2008-04-29 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4664873, 669096, 87808, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 9.  It makes me chuckle every time I see it.  My kids all went AWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW when they saw it and have tried to do the same with my dogs now and they are so not happy.!!  I now have a wet dog smell in the house!</td>', 'I gave this one a 9.  It makes me chuckle every time I see it.  My kids all went AWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW when they saw it and have tried to do the same with my dogs now and they are so not happy.!!  I now have a wet dog smell in the house!', '2008-04-29 12:14:24.000000', NULL, 0);
